export anchor IndigoDyedStyle:
    number: 255
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Indigo dyed
    idea: Panels sewn from deep indigo cloth, edged with white running stitches over a faint shibori ring pattern, with the inspector read like a woven care label and undyed cream for the one main action.
    base: dark
    palette:
        deep: #0b1430, the page with faint repeating ring patterns
        cloth: #12204a, stitched patches and the style sheet
        patch: #1a2d63, the care label inspector
        dyedTwice: #27428a, the selected layer and the pressed tool
        well: #0d1838, fields and the zoom pill
        ink: #eef2fb, text
        faded: #a9b8dc, meta, labels and status text
        stitch: #dfe6f5, dashed running stitch edges and status icons
        thread: #5f74ad, quiet dashed rules, dotted leaders and field borders
        undyed: #f4efe4, Share and the comment pin with deep indigo text
        persimmon: #f2c46b, the focus ring only
        madder: #c2462e, the 32 px guide with white text
    type:
        One humanist stack, Optima, Candara, Noto Sans, Segoe UI, system-ui.
        Base 14px at 1.55. The sheet title is 28px 600, the file name 17px
        600, panel titles 15px 600 beside a 13px faded context, layer names
        14px 600, meta 12px, and care label group names 11px caps tracked
        0.14em.
    layout:
        Every panel is a cloth patch with 14px corners and a dashed white
        stitch line inset 5px. A header patch spans the top with a cream
        square B mark, Canvas, Website redesign and Home v3, then In this file
        with three dashed ring avatars, a dashed Present and a cream pill
        Share. Below sit three columns with 14px gaps. A 76px tool rail patch
        holds six round tools stacked with small key letters, Move filled with
        the twice dyed blue and a dashed ring, then the 66% zoom pill. The
        canvas patch is darker with a dot grid, the white Hero frame and round
        handles, and the status line runs along its foot under a dashed rule.
        A 320px right column holds two patches, the layers list with dashed
        rules between rows, Hero highlighted with a dashed inner stitch and a
        Selected tag, then the inspector as a care label, a lighter rectangle
        where each line reads like a garment tag with a label, a dotted leader
        and a small right aligned value, grouped into Position and size, Fill,
        Auto layout Vertical, Corners and Export, with Export Hero below.
        Below 860px the patches stack with the canvas first and the rail
        becomes a sticky bottom tool bar.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 14px between patches, 18px patch padding, 8px layer rows.
    density: Medium. The rail, the canvas and one column of two patches.
    corners: 14px patches with a 10px stitch inset, round tools, pill buttons and fields, 6px care label.
    borders: A 1.5px dashed white running stitch inside each patch, dashed thread rules between rows and dotted leaders in the care label.
    shadows: None on panels. Only the mobile tool bar casts a soft shadow.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.6px stroke, 18 to 20px. Selected is a circled check,
        Collapsed a right chevron, Saved a cloud with a check, always with the
        word.
    focus: A 3px persimmon outline offset 3px.
    tone: Calm and plain, like a garment tag, with labels such as Width, Padding and Scale.
